--- /dev/null
+++ b/patch/u-boot/legacy/u-boot-radxa-rk35xx/board_recomputer-rk3576-devkit/0008-rk3576-rockusb-allow-empty-emmc.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Armbian Build <build@armbian.local>
+Date: Tue, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] rockusb: allow Loader entry on empty eMMC (no GPT)
+
+cmd/rockusb.c already special-cases nvme/scsi devnum 0 by appending
